0,Kaiy language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaiy_language,"Kaiy (Kai, Taori-Kei, Torweja) is a Lakes Plain language of Papua, Indonesia. It is spoken in Kai and Kokou villages in Rufaer District, Mamberamo Raya Regency. [2] Taorikei/Torweja are the original inhabitants of Kai I village, the original location of the village. Due to perpetual flooding, most moved to the new village of Kai II (or Bakaije), located on the banks of the Oi River, Haya ...",Kaiy,Lakes Plain
