9,"Taori-Kei, Kaiy in Indonesia people group profile | Joshua Project",https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/15261/ID,"The Kaiy or Taori-Kei people are a small indigenous group located in Papua Province, Indonesia. They inhabit the Lakes Plain area around the Kaiy airstrip on the lower Rouffaer River, specifically in Kaiy and Kokou villages.",Kaiy,Lakes Plain
